# Used instead of a root .dockerignore because the build context is the folder above ClaimApi.
# Paths are relative to that folder. Only the two source trees the Dockerfile copies are sent,
# without secrets, local settings, tests or build outputs.
*
!ClaimApi
!claim-client

# Secrets and local configuration
**/.env*
**/secrets.json
**/*.pfx
**/*.user
**/appsettings.*.local.json

# Tooling and VCS
**/.git
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/.claude

# Build outputs and dependencies
**/bin
**/obj
**/node_modules
claim-client/build
claim-client/coverage

# Not needed in the image
ClaimApi/Tests
ClaimApi/TestResults
ClaimApi/ModularMonolith/_requests
ClaimApi/docker-compose*
ClaimApi/**/Dockerfile*
